  <!-- end div center -->

  <p>
    Remember that it is an important skill to be able to sketch graphs by
    hand. However, when appropriate technology is there to assist. For
    example, you can use apps or web-based programs such as GeoGebra, Demos,
    PhET Simulations and Geometer's Sketch Pad.
  </p>
</section>
